@startuml dsd_uc1_makeNewSale_enterItem
' NewEra POS - Design sequence diagram, UC1 Process Sale: makeNewSale() and enterItem(itemID, quantity) (Contracts 1 and 2), W11
' Team D - editable source of assets/dsd_uc1_makeNewSale_enterItem.png
' Participants: classes of the logical view (architecture.md 4.2) and of the design class diagram skeleton.
' Operations: system_interfaces.md 3.2 and 4.3.
title DSD UC1 Process Sale - makeNewSale() and enterItem(itemID, quantity) (Contracts 1 and 2)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam BoxPadding 6
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBE6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B7791F
hide footbox
box "ui.api" #EAF2E3
  participant "ctrl:SaleController" as C
end box
box "application" #E8EEF7
  participant "h:SaleHandler" as H
end box
box "domain" #FFF7E0
  participant "session:CashierSession" as CS
  participant "s:Sale" as S
  participant "cat:ProductCatalog" as CAT
  participant "pd:ProductDescription" as PD
  participant "sli:SaleLineItem" as SLI
end box
box "technical.storage" #F2F2F2
  participant "repo:TransactionRepository" as TR
end box

== makeNewSale() (Contract 1) ==
[-> C : POST /api/sales
C -> H : makeNewSale()
H -> TR : nextTransactionID()
TR --> H : id (e.g. R02-000153)
H -> CS : createSale(id)
CS -> S ** : create(id, session)
note right of S : isComplete = false\nsubtotal = 0\nlinked to the open CashierSession
CS --> H : s
H --> C : saleID
C -->[ : 201 sale ID

== enterItem(itemID, quantity) (Contract 2), repeated for each item ==
[-> C : POST /api/sales/{saleID}/lines {itemID, quantity}
C -> C : check format (quantity is a whole number > 0)
C -> H : enterItem(itemID, quantity)
H -> CAT : getProduct(itemID)
note right of CAT : local copy of the catalog\n(ItemRepository), no external call (NFR-01)
alt unknown item ID (3a)
  CAT --> H : none
  H --> C : UNKNOWN_ITEM
  C -->[ : 404 "Item not found" (NFR-14)
else product found
  CAT --> H : pd
  H -> S : addLineItem(pd, quantity)
  S -> SLI ** : create(pd, quantity)
  SLI -> PD : getPrice()
  PD --> SLI : unitPrice
  S -> S : subtotal = subtotal + sli.getSubtotal()
  S --> H : sli, subtotal
  H -> PD : getStockLevel()
  PD --> H : stockLevel
  opt stockLevel - quantity < 0 (11c)
    H -> H : warning "stock below zero"\n(the sale goes on; the gap is recorded at payment, FR-19)
  end
  H --> C : LineResult(lineNumber, description, unitPrice, lineSubtotal, subtotal, warning)
  C -->[ : 201 line data and running subtotal
end

note over H
  GRASP
  Controller: SaleController receives the request; SaleHandler is the use-case controller of UC1.
  Creator: CashierSession creates the Sale (it records its transactions); Sale creates its SaleLineItems (composition).
  Information Expert: SaleLineItem knows its subtotal (price of its ProductDescription x quantity); Sale knows the running subtotal.
  Pure Fabrication: TransactionRepository gives the unique transaction ID (AD-05).
end note
@enduml
